# Lab 4

### 1) Build Docker Image (Multi-stage Build & Optimization)
```bash
docker build -t image2 .
```

### 2) Run the container
```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name multistage-app image2
```

### 3) Save image to tar archive
```bash
docker save image -o multistage.tar 
```

### 4) Load image from tar archive
```bash
docker load -i multistage.tar
```

### 5) Images Size Comparison (Multi-stage vs Single-stage with Maven)
```bash
docker images
```
```
REPOSITORY   TAG      IMAGE ID       SIZE
image1     latest    a8f08d1acc74    671MB
image2     latest    5f79cc38e6c8    522MB
```
